1
00:00:00,730 --> 00:00:02,503
 kurts geredt,

2
00:00:03,606 --> 00:00:05,068
in yeder lager

3
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:09,160
avu i- avu iz geven in GERMANye,

4
00:00:09,208 --> 00:00:11,109
avu der NEMETS iz geven,

5
00:00:11,436 --> 00:00:13,657
in yeder lager fun

6
00:00:15,132 --> 00:00:18,020
plene, fun gefangene,

7
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:20,306
hot men in yeder lager

8
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,909
gezukht yidn.

9
00:00:22,607 --> 00:00:25,149
zey hobn gehaltn a groyse

10
00:00:25,543 --> 00:00:27,798
tsol mentshn, farreter,

11
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:30,734
velkhe hobn iber hoypt gezukht yidn.

12
00:00:32,715 --> 00:00:35,071
ikh bin mispoel;

13
00:00:35,128 --> 00:00:40,471
bizl der letster minut, az zey hobn shoyn gefilt az ot iz zeyer sof,

14
00:00:41,507 --> 00:00:43,070
hot men gezukht yidn.

15
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:46,350
afile dan, az ikh bin geven

16
00:00:47,413 --> 00:00:48,858
in yener shtot,

17
00:00:49,135 --> 00:00:50,563
in LUDWIGSBURG,

18
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:52,346
avu zey hobn geharget

19
00:00:52,346 --> 00:00:55,457
yenem yat, yenem yidishn yat,

20
00:00:55,767 --> 00:00:57,178
iz shoyn geven

21
00:00:57,538 --> 00:01:02,007
der f- ferter I UNK der toyznt

22
00:01:02,007 --> 00:01:05,980
nayn hundert I fertsik ferter yor.

23
00:01:06,229 --> 00:01:08,906
di rusn zaynen shoyn geven

24
00:01:09,030 --> 00:01:12,061
ot shoyn oyf der doytshisher teritorye,

25
00:01:12,253 --> 00:01:14,542
oyf der doytshisher flakh shoyn ongehoybn geyn.

26
00:01:14,953 --> 00:01:18,630
hobn zey umedum geharget, gezukht yidn oyf hargenen.

27
00:01:18,630 --> 00:01:20,690
zey hobn tseharget ale gefangene,

28
00:01:20,690 --> 00:01:23,230
vi m'hot im nor gekhapt in gefangenshaft, oyfn,

29
00:01:23,230 --> 00:01:26,034
oyfn feld fun, shlakht.

30
00:01:26,867 --> 00:01:30,472
dernokh dem in yeder lager flegt men zukhn, tomer epes imetser ⟨iz⟩ geven

31
00:01:30,495 --> 00:01:33,509
enlekh, afile nit keyn yid, hot men oykh im geharget.

32
00:01:33,853 --> 00:01:38,251
abi hargenen toyznt nit keyn yidn,

33
00:01:38,646 --> 00:01:40,057
kedey pakn a yidn.

34
00:01:40,452 --> 00:01:43,430
azoy zaynen zey geven meshuge,

35
00:01:43,573 --> 00:01:46,937
umgliks-meshuge, nit erdish,

36
00:01:46,937 --> 00:01:50,520
nit far a lebedikn mentshn — sheydim!

37
00:01:51,589 --> 00:01:55,270
sheydim, ergere fun erd sheydim,

38
00:01:55,723 --> 00:01:58,650
ergere fun genem. dos iz nit keyn mentshn.

39
00:01:58,650 --> 00:02:00,970
ikh farshtey nit far vos

40
00:02:00,970 --> 00:02:04,053
trogn zey nit bay hayntikn tog

41
00:02:04,532 --> 00:02:07,680
dem flikht far di yidn,

42
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:10,972
UNK far yeder yidn darfn zey fardinen: far im,

43
00:02:12,413 --> 00:02:14,010
far mir gevis,

44
00:02:14,691 --> 00:02:16,862
far di gehargete ale yidn!

45
00:02:16,868 --> 00:02:18,653
s'iz nit nor dos.

46
00:02:18,653 --> 00:02:22,880
m'hot dokh tseharget ale yidn. dos iz nit keyn finf toy- zeks toyznt; dos iz,

47
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:25,369
dos iz zibn milyo- nit zibn milyon.

48
00:02:25,369 --> 00:02:27,700
dos iz mer, mer eyder zibn milyon.

49
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:30,817
un vifl ⟨hobn⟩ zikh nit gehat az⟨UNK⟩ mer eyder azoy fil?

50
00:02:31,009 --> 00:02:34,192
un vos host geshen nokh dem ⟨p-⟩ tsu dir?

51
00:02:33,473 --> 00:02:36,859
nokh dem iz nor oyf arbet hot men getribn.

52
00:02:37,354 --> 00:02:42,930
m'hot getribn in HEILBRONN, in MÜNSINGEN, in, SÖLLINGEN bin ikh gevezn

53
00:02:42,930 --> 00:02:46,747
in di lagern. in eyn lager hot men getribn, mir zoln,

54
00:02:47,142 --> 00:02:49,718
dortn a taykh iz geven, vu s'iz geven

55
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:53,840
aza min, stantsye, oyf rusish ruft zikh

56
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:58,292
ELEKTRO- ELEKTRO-, vos makht elektrye,

57
00:02:58,292 --> 00:03:01,887
makht elektrye a vaser. vaser falt,

58
00:03:01,887 --> 00:03:04,770
di taykh, oyfgehoybn in der heykh

59
00:03:04,770 --> 00:03:08,688
aza min o hoykhe gebay- hoykher vant,

60
00:03:08,688 --> 00:03:10,524
un es falt di vaser,

61
00:03:10,767 --> 00:03:14,180
un es, nu, di vaser dreyen di turbines,

62
00:03:14,180 --> 00:03:16,836
un es git elektrye. hobn mir gedarft

63
00:03:16,875 --> 00:03:19,704
SVAes oto do o mit shteyner,

64
00:03:19,744 --> 00:03:22,421
mit shteyner oysleygn di taykh.

65
00:03:22,630 --> 00:03:25,285
in a tsveytn ort hot men undz getribn, mir zoln,

66
00:03:25,285 --> 00:03:29,138
⟨, a,⟩ etlekhe monatn,

67
00:03:29,177 --> 00:03:30,667
a monatn finf,

68
00:03:30,667 --> 00:03:37,122
mir zoln, banen, banen, f- flegn mir, vagones... oyf rusish ruft zikh VAGON.

69
00:03:37,122 --> 00:03:39,670
nu, veyst dokh, der ban hot vagonen...

70
00:03:39,670 --> 00:03:43,910
mir zoln ahin o,

71
00:03:43,910 --> 00:03:50,680
 onleygn mit, alerleyike shvere konstruktsyes tsum front firn:

72
00:03:51,216 --> 00:03:55,090
ayzene un hiltserne un tsementne,

73
00:03:55,090 --> 00:03:57,085
fun dos o, fun shteyner.

74
00:03:57,085 --> 00:04:01,080
itster, ⟨p-⟩ pek mit, shtekh-drot...

75
00:04:01,189 --> 00:04:03,480
bukhtes, ruft zikh bukhtes...

76
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:08,400
hot men undz gegebn ⟨ay- hi-⟩ ETO, fun,

77
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:13,270
fun leder hentshikes un mir hobn gedarft di shtekh-drot, ot di o, leygn

78
00:04:13,270 --> 00:04:16,167
in dos, aynleygn gantse ETO.

79
00:04:16,562 --> 00:04:21,601
in a tsveytn ort iz in vald hot men undz getribn ar- arbetn.

80
00:04:21,861 --> 00:04:23,240
ot azoy,

81
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:30,580
m'hot undz gemutshet bizl sof UNK ⟨VOEN-⟩ gefangene. ikh bin,

82
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:32,919
ikh hob, ikh hob nit nor

83
00:04:32,919 --> 00:04:35,507
gehorevet shtark vi ale,

84
00:04:35,547 --> 00:04:37,956
nit nor gehungert vi ale,

85
00:04:37,956 --> 00:04:40,210
nor ikh hob dokh gehat mayn tsore,

86
00:04:40,210 --> 00:04:42,172
mayn tsore vos ikh bin a yid,

87
00:04:42,178 --> 00:04:44,230
vos ot vet men zikh khapn,

88
00:04:44,230 --> 00:04:46,947
imetser vet unterzogn, biz der letster minut.

89
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:53,770
nor ikh vel shoyn durkhlozn di alerleyike ⟨V-⟩ zakhn vos s'iz geven,

90
00:04:53,770 --> 00:04:55,650
mayne iberlebungen,

91
00:04:55,650 --> 00:05:01,716
in alerleyike m- in alerleyike, bin ikh geven nokh mageyfes.

92
00:05:01,716 --> 00:05:05,139
nor in eynem a tog

93
00:05:05,685 --> 00:05:08,902
hot men undz oyfgehoybn alemen far tog

94
00:05:09,010 --> 00:05:11,839
un m'hot gezogt az "me traybt aykh nit oyf arbet."

95
00:05:11,878 --> 00:05:13,407
dos iz shoyn geven

96
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:16,680
ergets in APREL'...

97
00:05:18,004 --> 00:05:19,685
dos iz geven in APREL'.

98
00:05:19,962 --> 00:05:22,203
dos iz geven in APREL',

99
00:05:22,203 --> 00:05:27,549
ergets fertsnte APREL' toyznt nayn hundert I fertsik finftn yor.

100
00:05:27,842 --> 00:05:29,608
dos iz yetst di bafrayt?

101
00:05:29,479 --> 00:05:30,316
ye.

102
00:05:30,431 --> 00:05:31,620
vos hot geshen?

103
00:05:31,217 --> 00:05:34,873
un do hot men undz ongehoybn traybn. m'hot undz nit gezogt a bafrayung.

104
00:05:35,098 --> 00:05:38,365
es geyt vakh mit,

105
00:05:38,406 --> 00:05:42,370
mit ETO SAMOE, mit di gever,

106
00:05:42,370 --> 00:05:44,520
un me h⟨ey-⟩ traybt undz.

107
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:47,827
fun fornt geyt eyner, un do bay di zaytn

108
00:05:47,827 --> 00:05:50,617
hiter, un me traybt undz.

109
00:05:50,725 --> 00:05:56,729
m'hot undz getribn durkh, alerleyike felder, durkh vegns,

110
00:05:56,729 --> 00:05:58,362
farbay velder.

111
00:05:59,837 --> 00:06:05,010
mir veysn nit avuhin me traybt. es flien aeroplanen,

112
00:06:05,010 --> 00:06:10,389
 kleyne aeroplanlekh lozn zikh arop. zey derzeen ver e- vos far a kolone

113
00:06:10,389 --> 00:06:12,538
a groyse, makhn zey mit di,

114
00:06:12,882 --> 00:06:14,423
mit di KRYLes.

115
00:06:14,423 --> 00:06:17,460
zey gerisn undz. zey shisn nit in undz.

116
00:06:17,623 --> 00:06:22,510
un di vakh-manes shrekn zikh. zey loyfn zikh bahaltn in di KYUVETn.

117
00:06:23,901 --> 00:06:28,490
farshteyst? ot azoy hot men undz dertribn biz eynem a brik,

118
00:06:29,672 --> 00:06:32,310
a taykhl un a brik.

119
00:06:34,212 --> 00:06:37,690
der vos iz geven fun fornt hot gezogt,

120
00:06:38,869 --> 00:06:42,370
"for-, f- foroys!" "VORWÄRTS!"

121
00:06:43,341 --> 00:06:46,541
bin ikh ave- zaynen mir avekgegangen ale

122
00:06:47,104 --> 00:06:48,949
VPERЁD. mir hobn nit gevust, efsher

123
00:06:48,949 --> 00:06:50,709
kenen zey undz tseshisn,

124
00:06:50,715 --> 00:06:54,200
efsher kenen zey undz epes ton. ver veys?

125
00:06:54,529 --> 00:06:57,797
nor mir geyen. nor do hobn ⟨me-⟩ mir derzen

126
00:06:58,647 --> 00:07:02,320
az rern

127
00:07:03,287 --> 00:07:08,242
fun, tanken. TANKI! mir hobn derzen TANKI STOYAT!

128
00:07:10,324 --> 00:07:12,225
Amerikaner tanken.

129
00:07:15,994 --> 00:07:17,810
mir zaynen ibergegangen dem brik.

130
00:07:17,810 --> 00:07:19,414
mir hobn ongehoybn loyfn.

131
00:07:19,588 --> 00:07:21,399
mir zaynen shoyn nit gegangen;

132
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:22,873
mir zaynen gelofn.

133
00:07:23,622 --> 00:07:26,560
mir zaynen gelofn oyf der bafrayung.

134
00:07:27,418 --> 00:07:31,327
es iz geven moyer, moyer, moyers.

135
00:07:31,452 --> 00:07:33,488
in di moyers zaynen geshtanen

136
00:07:33,662 --> 00:07:37,040
Amerikaner soldatn.

137
00:07:37,915 --> 00:07:40,626
me hot undz gevorfn in peklekh GALETn.

138
00:07:41,205 --> 00:07:43,325
me hot undz gevorfn papirosn.

139
00:07:43,905 --> 00:07:45,890
eynike hobn geshrien hura.

140
00:07:48,073 --> 00:07:50,902
bay mir iz gegangen trern.

141
00:07:51,364 --> 00:07:52,725
ikh hob geveynt.

142
00:07:55,043 --> 00:07:57,669
ale shrayen hura. ikh hob geveynt.

143
00:07:57,777 --> 00:07:59,796
fregt bay mir MELKONYAN,

144
00:08:00,088 --> 00:08:02,557
"CHTO TY PLACHESH'?" "vos veynstu?

145
00:08:02,557 --> 00:08:05,955
me darf zikh freyen!" er nemt mir arum un er kusht mir.

146
00:08:07,395 --> 00:08:08,519
zog ikh,

147
00:08:09,893 --> 00:08:13,150
"YA," zog ikh, "PLACH- ikh veyn

148
00:08:13,150 --> 00:08:15,641
vayle mir hot men geratevet."

149
00:08:16,491 --> 00:08:18,257
mir hot men geratevet.

150
00:08:18,634 --> 00:08:23,080
im hot men bafrayt,

151
00:08:23,275 --> 00:08:25,733
nor mir hot me⟨n⟩ geratevet.

152
00:08:26,093 --> 00:08:29,870
farshteyst? ikh bin a, geratevet gevorn do o.

153
00:08:30,649 --> 00:08:32,260
⟨der⟩far hot zikh mir geveynt.

154
00:08:32,260 --> 00:08:36,290
mir hot zikh geveynt far di dray yor f- hinterdike.

155
00:08:36,290 --> 00:08:37,510
mir hot zikh geveynt,

156
00:08:37,510 --> 00:08:40,650
vos ikh hob gevis gevust az mayne zaynen geharget gevorn,

157
00:08:40,650 --> 00:08:43,690
un er fort aveket in Armenye...

158
00:08:43,690 --> 00:08:45,999
nit in Armenye; er hot gelebt in KRASNODAR.

159
00:08:46,039 --> 00:08:47,445
er hot dortn a vayb.

160
00:08:47,445 --> 00:08:48,871
er hot dortn a tatn.

161
00:08:48,871 --> 00:08:50,488
er hot dortn shvester.

162
00:08:50,562 --> 00:08:55,230
er hot dortn o, brider. er hot, er veys avuhin er fort.

163
00:08:56,265 --> 00:08:57,845
im hot men bafrayt,

164
00:08:59,083 --> 00:09:00,793
un mir hot men geratevet.

165
00:09:00,793 --> 00:09:02,891
nor geratevet tsulib vos?

166
00:09:03,420 --> 00:09:04,831
avuhin forn?

167
00:09:04,855 --> 00:09:06,300
avuhin geyn?

168
00:09:06,745 --> 00:09:09,422
ot dos iz an ander frage.

169
00:09:09,900 --> 00:09:14,214
iz oyb ir't veln, iz yene frage bay mir mer a komplitsirtere,

170
00:09:14,794 --> 00:09:17,190
a mer durkhgetrakhte,

171
00:09:17,190 --> 00:09:21,160
un a mer vegn ir hob ikh adurkhgelebte.

172
00:09:25,594 --> 00:09:27,697
"der veldl hot geveynt,

173
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,802
a gedikhter fun bleter-beymer.

174
00:09:32,310 --> 00:09:34,720
itst shoklen zikh di kroynen in der,

175
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,945
iber der langer grub mit beyner.

176
00:09:38,217 --> 00:09:40,626
me hot gebrakht fun Paritsh

177
00:09:40,626 --> 00:09:42,513
kleyne kinder shtile,

178
00:09:43,110 --> 00:09:44,786
oysgeton zey naket,

179
00:09:44,786 --> 00:09:46,377
di hemdelekh afile.

180
00:09:47,768 --> 00:09:51,470
un a grub far alemen iz shoyn greyt geshtanen,

181
00:09:51,700 --> 00:09:53,736
nor der klenster Yankele

182
00:09:53,978 --> 00:09:55,811
hot gornisht nit farshtanen.

183
00:09:56,307 --> 00:09:59,423
Yankele der lakhinker hot dem kop farrisn.

184
00:09:59,682 --> 00:10:05,447
ver shit es kalte zamd oyf im? vil der kleyner visn.

185
00:10:06,246 --> 00:10:09,311
un di dine hentelekh hot er oysgetsoygn:

186
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:14,593
"feterlekh, vos shit ir zamd mir in di oygn?"

187
00:10:15,223 --> 00:10:17,245
hobn di feterlekh gelakht

188
00:10:17,245 --> 00:10:19,742
un geshotn flinker.

189
00:10:19,742 --> 00:10:23,890
eyner hot mitn ridl im dem kop tseplakht

190
00:10:23,890 --> 00:10:25,747
mit der hant der linker.

191
00:10:27,610 --> 00:10:30,726
nit keyn zaft oyf beymer flist —

192
00:10:31,838 --> 00:10:34,940
blut oyf beymer-bleter.

193
00:10:35,308 --> 00:10:37,920
kinder, mayne taybelekh,

194
00:10:38,642 --> 00:10:40,870
eybik lebn vet ir."

195
00:10:50,948 --> 00:10:52,325
bay mir iz do

196
00:10:54,542 --> 00:10:55,886
in der heft

197
00:10:56,128 --> 00:10:58,332
iz bay mir yidishe lider,

198
00:10:59,672 --> 00:11:02,501
nor vegn der yidisher geto,

199
00:11:03,756 --> 00:11:07,277
vegn mayne eltern, briderlekh un shvesterlekh,

200
00:11:07,890 --> 00:11:10,516
velkhe me hot getribn ale Paritsher...

201
00:11:11,299 --> 00:11:13,351
a sakhn iz do ibergerekhnt.

202
00:11:15,872 --> 00:11:19,409
mit deroyf fleg ikh aroystretn in di klubn,

203
00:11:20,817 --> 00:11:24,540
in teatern. me flegt mir rufn in shtot Minsk,

204
00:11:24,630 --> 00:11:28,570
Babruysk, GOMEL', in Vitebsk.

205
00:11:28,731 --> 00:11:30,463
es iz gevorn klubn

206
00:11:30,722 --> 00:11:32,336
fun yidishe kultur.

207
00:11:33,051 --> 00:11:35,019
flegt men mir aynladn.

208
00:11:35,599 --> 00:11:37,162
ikh fleg reydn,

209
00:11:37,270 --> 00:11:40,031
lekhatkhile hob ikh gevolt nor oyf yidish.

210
00:11:40,847 --> 00:11:43,912
dernokh dem hob ikh derzen az di yungvarg

211
00:11:44,998 --> 00:11:46,443
farshteyen dos nit.

212
00:11:47,344 --> 00:11:49,700
dortn merheyt yungvarg flegn kumen.

213
00:11:50,432 --> 00:11:54,820
zey hobn ale gevolt avekforn, ver in IZRAIL'

214
00:11:55,107 --> 00:11:59,270
ver in Amerike, ver in AVSTRALye, Kanade.

215
00:11:59,550 --> 00:12:02,829
 bay mir iz a sakh... ot iz ongeshribn oyf rusish...

216
00:12:03,190 --> 00:12:04,804
zeyer gute lider,

217
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:08,320
zeyer iberlebndike,

218
00:12:09,079 --> 00:12:11,401
IMENNO di lider velkhe me hert.

219
00:12:11,897 --> 00:12:15,485
es ken aroystretn an emeser dikhter, hob ikh oysgezen,

220
00:12:16,048 --> 00:12:17,560
iz hert men im nit.

221
00:12:18,411 --> 00:12:20,483
ikh bin nit keyn emeser dikhter;

222
00:12:20,483 --> 00:12:22,185
ikh bin gevorn a dikhter.

223
00:12:23,305 --> 00:12:25,087
dos iz nit mayn fakh.

224
00:12:25,768 --> 00:12:27,399
nor me flegt veynen.

225
00:12:27,777 --> 00:12:29,543
ale flegn dos hern.

226
00:12:29,717 --> 00:12:32,480
bay alemen flegn geyn trern in di oygn.

227
00:12:32,552 --> 00:12:34,880
keyner hot nit gedarft hobn di lid

228
