436
00:24:31,410 --> 00:24:34,208
vos di mame flegt vashn di kleyne kinder,

437
00:24:34,208 --> 00:24:37,103
un gelegn a tsebrokhene bet,

438
00:24:37,103 --> 00:24:40,213
mit galkes gevezn, an ayzene bet,

439
00:24:39,570 --> 00:24:45,990
un vi hostu ⟨ge⟩vust vos hot geshen mit dayn mishpokhe? vi azoy d⟨i⟩, gevust... yo.

440
00:24:40,371 --> 00:24:41,462
un a grub.

441
00:24:43,695 --> 00:24:46,372
vegn mayn mishpokhe iz geven azoy:

442
00:24:46,800 --> 00:24:48,296
⟨az di,⟩ oyfn,

443
00:24:48,808 --> 00:24:54,505
mayn tate hot gearbet a shmid in a kolkhoz, kh'hob dir gezogt, in a ferme.

444
00:24:55,288 --> 00:24:59,568
hot im, bay im iz geven di mame, zayn mame hot nit gekent geyn.

445
00:25:00,182 --> 00:25:01,678
iz der,

446
00:25:01,954 --> 00:25:05,458
di- direktor, der balebos fun kolkhoz,

447
00:25:05,498 --> 00:25:06,633
fun der ferme,

448
00:25:06,633 --> 00:25:08,372
hot im gegebn a ferd

449
00:25:08,372 --> 00:25:10,550
mit a fur, mit a vogn.

450
00:25:10,645 --> 00:25:13,204
hot er gekumen, hot avekgeleygt di mame zayne,

451
00:25:15,859 --> 00:25:17,490
un hot tsunoyfgeklibn

452
00:25:18,846 --> 00:25:20,949
zayne tsvey shvester,

453
00:25:21,748 --> 00:25:23,142
nu, mayn mame

454
00:25:23,638 --> 00:25:28,160
mit ire kinder,

455
00:25:29,130 --> 00:25:33,460
un di kinder fun der, fun di shvester,

456
00:25:33,949 --> 00:25:35,820
un geklibn zikh forn.

457
00:25:35,820 --> 00:25:37,875
do ⟨gey-⟩ kumt onet... es iz geven,

458
00:25:38,016 --> 00:25:41,267
di milkhome hot zikh ongehoybn shoyn, es geyt der tsveyter tog...

459
00:25:41,458 --> 00:25:44,742
iz ongegangen eyner a antisemit

460
00:25:44,766 --> 00:25:46,205
fun VOENKOMAT...

461
00:25:46,205 --> 00:25:49,950
s'iz geven a, a, a militerishe organizatsye,

462
00:25:49,950 --> 00:25:53,349
velkhe flegt mobilizirn mentshn, nemen mentshn

463
00:25:53,406 --> 00:25:56,727
oyf geyn arbetn, oyf geyn in armey.

464
00:25:56,727 --> 00:25:59,849
der tate iz shoyn geven an elterer mentsh; im iz shoyn geven

465
00:25:59,849 --> 00:26:01,365
fertsik tsvey yor.

466
00:26:01,877 --> 00:26:03,992
tsvey un fertsik yor im shoyn geven.

467
00:26:03,992 --> 00:26:05,820
er hot im nit getort tshepen.

468
00:26:06,501 --> 00:26:08,891
er hot im tsugenumen fun der mishpokhe

469
00:26:10,146 --> 00:26:12,603
un hot avekgeshlept hinter shtot GOMEL'.

470
00:26:14,483 --> 00:26:17,717
dortn hot men im opgelozn. m'hot gezogt, er iz tsu alt.

471
00:26:19,815 --> 00:26:21,851
hot er gelofn shoyn aheym

472
00:26:22,212 --> 00:26:25,260
durkh di NEME- NEMishe kordones.

473
00:26:25,705 --> 00:26:29,614
er hot nit gekent lozn dortn di gantse FAMILY un aleyn blaybn lebn,

474
00:26:31,003 --> 00:26:32,718
iz er gekumen ahin.

475
00:26:33,957 --> 00:26:35,773
UNK arayngehakt in lager.

476
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:39,688
dernokh dem, di mame,

477
00:26:39,863 --> 00:26:42,067
 mayne hot zikh geven bahaltn,

478
00:26:44,318 --> 00:26:46,593
mit der, shvesterl.

479
00:26:46,593 --> 00:26:49,509
dem kleynem Yankelen hot men ⟨tse-⟩ geharget.

480
00:26:49,802 --> 00:26:51,990
m'hot im fargrobn lebedikerheyt.

481
00:26:52,671 --> 00:26:55,939
dos iz geven akhtsnte SENTYABR'

482
00:26:56,890 --> 00:27:00,210
in toyznt nayn hundert I fertsik eyntn yor.

